sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Screen
  participant N as SubmissionNotifier
  participant U as Use case
  S->>N: submit()
  N->>N: state = isSubmitting true
  N->>U: ref.read(submitLoanProvider).call(form)
  U-->>N: result
  N->>N: if not ref.mounted, return
  N->>N: state = doneEvent Event(result.id)
  N-->>S: ref.listen sees doneEvent
  S->>S: screen navigates
  Note over N: No BuildContext, no navigation,<br/>no appRef in the notifier
